Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, part-timer!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.66,0:00:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.13,0:00:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.70,0:00:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You said it'd be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.36,0:00:30.49,Default,,0,0,0,,more efficient if we took breaks...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.49,0:00:32.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you're the one who needs to rest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.38,0:00:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,every few steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.58,0:00:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to hide from Organization pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.80,0:00:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No one's chasing us.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.69,0:00:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe Rintaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.09,0:00:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.06,0:00:42.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, it would be top secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.64,0:00:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and I wouldn't be able to just tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.65,0:00:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're going to take your sweet time, then put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Endure, assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.69,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Then stop making a big deal out of it and just tell her!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.61,0:00:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.11,0:00:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,This item is of the utmost importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.87,0:01:00.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If we don't make a big deal out of it here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.37,0:01:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,then where {\i1}should{\i0} we make a big deal out of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.99,0:01:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it an IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.87,0:01:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,She found out, Christina!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.75,0:01:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you find one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.58,0:01:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It was kept at Yanabayashi Shrine,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.00,0:01:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,where I, the mad scientist chosen by God...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.13,0:01:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I said, put it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.38,0:01:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Makise Kurisu...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.89,0:01:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.85,0:01:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.97,0:01:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,A part-timer at the CRT TV Workshop...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.23,0:01:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.19,0:01:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Part-timer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.90,0:01:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.62,0:01:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was she glaring at me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.20,0:01:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you look like a thug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.14,0:02:15.81,op trans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,0)}Even the billions of heartbeats in the world
