Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.69,0:03:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really big!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.82,0:03:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Like a tiger rug!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.28,0:03:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe a mattress.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii is lying on my shirt.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.91,0:03:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The sight warms my heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.54,0:03:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, let it down slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.62,0:03:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for coming by so suddenly again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.13,0:03:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You can come whenever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lab mem, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yesterday, she said she'd never come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.22,0:04:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You change your mind quite easily, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not here because I want to be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.93,0:04:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who asked me for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.15,0:04:11.23,Default,,0,0,0,,So you don't want to come here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.23,0:04:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it. It's not that I don't like this place...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.57,0:04:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's in the box?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.36,0:04:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.78,0:04:19.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Normally, it would be...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.95,0:04:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,An IBN 5100.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.62,0:04:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously? Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.74,0:04:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Way to go, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.74,0:04:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,He does things only an Okarin can!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.87,0:04:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And that's why we love him—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.00,0:04:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't admire him, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, boot it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.67,0:04:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We found it thanks to Mayushii.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.09,0:04:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.09,0:04:42.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You get all the credit for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.22,0:04:46.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It turned on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you can analyze that program code, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.19,0:04:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that simple...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.02,0:04:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how to use this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It predates the Internet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.07,0:04:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,so I can't hook it up to anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.78,0:05:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,For now, I'll need these parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.20,0:05:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard the man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:06.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take care of it, assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.08,0:05:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to stop talking to me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.21,0:05:10.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.41,0:05:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,N-o-p-e.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:13.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.79,0:05:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Makise probably doesn't know Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.00,0:05:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.26,0:05:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.05,0:05:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii will do her best to show Kurisu around the lab
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.72,0:05:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,so she'll like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.97,0:05:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I'll stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.39,0:05:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Christina, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you've ensnared Mayuri with your feminine wiles as well—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.48,0:05:32.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I did no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:34.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Miss Makise seducing Mayushii...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.77,0:05:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuri is in the air...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.52,0:05:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop imagining those things, pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.28,0:05:41.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nice for girls to be together, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.20,0:05:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, why don't you show me around?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.16,0:05:44.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.32,0:05:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll start with the shower room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.12,0:05:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It has a shower...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.04,0:05:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but sometimes, if you use it for too long, the water gets cold, so be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.09,0:06:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean... you use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.34,0:06:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, once in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.18,0:06:07.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Please promise me you'll never use the shower here again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.10,0:06:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.64,0:06:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.93,0:06:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,It's suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.06,0:06:13.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, what are you doing here, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.39,0:06:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he threaten or blackmail
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.65,0:06:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,you into becoming a member against your will?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.86,0:06:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii is Okarin's hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.16,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I should call the police.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.45,0:06:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.66,0:06:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,She just said she was your hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.62,0:06:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That's real evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.70,0:06:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.33,0:06:36.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii became a hostage on her own!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.21,0:06:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.46,0:06:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be going.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.46,0:06:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.76,0:06:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This should work as a replacement, I'm pretty sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.60,0:06:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.43,0:06:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Think you'll be able to use that IBN 5100?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.23,0:06:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say that name here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.65,0:06:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Collecting parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.61,0:07:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Want some help?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:04.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect a part-time warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to be so knowledgeable about PCs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.11,0:07:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I once knew someone who knew a lot about IBN.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.16,0:07:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.12,0:07:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to contact them for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.83,0:07:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse, you'll experience the worst hell this world has to offer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.67,0:07:21.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I said it's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.17,0:07:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you value your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because the person I'm talking about is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He died years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.47,0:07:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.26,0:07:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I should be apologizing for earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.85,0:07:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Did my assistant do something to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.02,0:07:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.98,0:07:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Like maybe she glared at you first...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.07,0:07:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I know! She snorted at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.86,0:07:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.03,0:07:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't done anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.86,0:07:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.66,0:07:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't know anything yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.54,0:07:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but be wary of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.29,0:08:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.46,0:08:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bombs?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.55,0:08:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They're broadcasting the fireworks show.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.39,0:08:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,That's today, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.97,0:08:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks... Fireworks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:15.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard of those!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.64,0:08:17.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You've never seen any?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.85,0:08:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are they? Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go out that way, toward the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.36,0:08:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,and you should be able to see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.94,0:08:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.32,0:08:31.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your email address.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.74,0:08:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,A festival?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.91,0:08:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.83,0:08:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.21,0:08:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Not really...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.38,0:08:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Heading home?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.18,0:08:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find the parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.43,0:08:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got them all right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.10,0:08:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.89,0:08:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So, you're going to start experimenting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Interested?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.98,0:09:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You are, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.73,0:09:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'm not interested\Nin that SERN conspiracy nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.15,0:09:11.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.45,0:09:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm heading back to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.33,0:09:17.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:19.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Then Mayushii is going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.21,0:09:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.42,0:09:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Kurisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.42,0:09:23.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.88,0:09:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll come back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.50,0:09:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.59,0:09:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a member until I return to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.51,0:09:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.30,0:09:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.14,0:09:39.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you're going to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.89,0:09:43.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She said you're childhood friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.31,0:09:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you grow up
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.19,0:09:48.40,Default,,0,0,0,,in the same environment and end up this socially awkward?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:51.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri has always been a bit of a weird one...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.61,0:09:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I was talking about you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:57.41,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\fscx73.75\fscy88.75\frz340.327\pos(1048.5,414)\frx358\fry0}Part-Time Warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:57.41,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs49.5\an8\blur2.7\frx4\fry2\frz339.53\pos(1221,555)}First\N Message
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:57.41,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\blur2.7\frx2\fry358\frz337.607\pos(243,586.5)}More than I imagined! \NFireworks are great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.91,0:09:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,First Message.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,More than I imagined!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Fireworks are great!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.38,0:10:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It never worked after that, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.34,0:10:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm borrowing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.47,0:10:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Lab coats always calm me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.93,0:10:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.43,0:10:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I was right...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.77,0:10:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.15,0:10:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.11,0:10:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're creeping me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A lab coat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.82,0:10:33.49,Default,,0,0,0,,In a research organization, a lab coat is also a uniform!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.57,0:10:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I keep telling Daru and Mayuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.12,0:10:37.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but neither of them seems to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:39.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You understand, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's both stand with our hands in our pockets!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.58,0:10:44.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,L-Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.42,0:10:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a pose of radiant intelligence, only possible for those
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.59,0:10:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,who spend their lives in research!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.01,0:10:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you that lab coat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.05,0:10:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us bask in this glory together...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.60,0:11:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I really do feel like you're mocking me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.48,0:11:05.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.23,0:11:06.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't eaten since lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.23,0:11:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:12.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in a good mood today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.94,0:11:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Bon appétit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.20,0:11:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.07,0:11:16.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you dissatisfied?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.91,0:11:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:19.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.16,0:11:22.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got some cup ramen I bought.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,But I imagine you wouldn't want it,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.25,0:11:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,being raised in America and all...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Cup ramen?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.63,0:11:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have some cup ramen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.42,0:11:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What flavors?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.76,0:11:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Soy sauce and salt!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll have the salt flavor...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.76,0:11:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and a fork too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.47,0:11:46.27,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't hurry, time will run out, and you'll lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.56,0:11:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.85,0:11:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a virus card at the end, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.36,0:11:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.78,0:11:55.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You may think that if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll just put this here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.74,0:12:00.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.12,0:12:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You like Dr Pepper, assistant?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.08,0:12:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent seven years in America, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.21,0:12:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to drink with you sometime...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.46,0:12:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I'm a minor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.38,0:12:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I meant someone to drink Dr Pepper with.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:20.89,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.89,0:12:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.01,0:12:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We can partake in the intellectual experience that is Dr Pepper...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.35,0:12:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to look at my card while you're saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.03,0:12:38.90,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.66,0:12:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not very good at thinking strategically, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.91,0:12:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You only consider your own strategy,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.79,0:12:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,never thinking about your opponent's plan
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.92,0:12:52.21,Default,,0,0,0,,or whether something's a trap...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.67,0:12:57.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.46,0:13:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I said you're not good at thinking strategically.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's true, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.76,0:13:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Before that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.22,0:13:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,You said Okabe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.31,0:13:10.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm younger than you, but for someone
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not showing respect for...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.86,0:13:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.11,0:13:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Hououin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.24,0:13:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times must I tell you, Christina?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.36,0:13:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,From now on, remember to call me Hououin!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.03,0:13:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or... Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.13,0:13:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.17,0:13:38.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I definitely wasn't terrified by a guy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,screaming in my face,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.26,0:13:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,so I definitely didn't start crying from relief afterwards!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.35,0:13:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.93,0:13:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru, why's my assistant crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.39,0:13:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She just told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.94,0:14:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,And I put this here... Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,If this goes here, then this goes here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.58,0:14:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.75,0:14:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not your assistant, but what?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.54,0:14:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you head back to your hotel for the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.67,0:14:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's close, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.63,0:14:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.09,0:14:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If it doesn't work by morning, I'll head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.55,0:14:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to talk to your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom's in America,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.26,0:14:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and I haven't spoken to my dad in seven years,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.35,0:14:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,so I don't have anyone to contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.10,0:14:31.35,Default,,0,0,0,,A prodigal perverted genius girl, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.35,0:14:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop making it even weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.44,0:14:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.27,0:14:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.90,0:14:40.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.73,0:14:42.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mission complete second!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.74,0:14:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,So what's the result?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.61,0:14:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen anything yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.74,0:14:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but I got the Z-program...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.91,0:14:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It says 1973?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.25,0:14:52.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.33,0:14:53.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When was SERN founded?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.75,0:14:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,1954.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.58,0:14:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,When was the IBN 5100 created?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.67,0:14:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,1975.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,SERN gave the IBN 5100
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.42,0:15:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,a special programming language just for this plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's going too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.80,0:15:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.05,0:15:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we read this report, we'll know, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.68,0:15:15.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's just an old particle physics report
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and has nothing to do with conspiracy theories.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.86,0:15:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,A JPEG? Seriously? Screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.94,0:15:21.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't copy and paste that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not in French?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.61,0:15:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, "Time Control and Its Destruction of History"...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. Miss Makise can read English.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.70,0:15:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Well done, assistant!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.37,0:15:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything you did in America was for this moment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.12,0:15:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The hell it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.13,0:15:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.88,0:15:42.80,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, SERN's raison d'être in the 21st century
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.80,0:15:46.72,Default,,0,0,0,,is to create a utopia spanning the past, present, and future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.09,0:15:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,A utopia...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.72,0:15:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Dystopia!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.93,0:15:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.43,0:15:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, show me the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.64,0:15:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I can try, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.27,0:15:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... For security reasons, this experiment...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.10,0:15:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.56,0:16:01.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Those engaged by the program...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.06,0:16:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.36,0:16:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The Z-program will experiment
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.65,0:16:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,with the possibility of transference through space-time
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.70,0:16:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,via high-energy proton collision...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.99,0:16:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Space-time travel...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,They're talking about time travel!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.29,0:16:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.58,0:16:21.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it! SERN's been investigating time travel for forty years!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.29,0:16:21.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too early to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.13,0:16:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Program Stage One:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.71,0:16:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Construction and implementation of the Large Hadron.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.55,0:16:30.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Program Stage Two:
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:32.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Implementation and tuning of the lifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:33.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Lifter? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.93,0:16:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,It was on the news a while back, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.52,0:16:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing they called an ionocraft.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.56,0:16:41.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It's floating?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.69,0:16:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Supposedly, the phenomenon occurs when you run a high voltage current through aluminum.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.44,0:16:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that have anything to do with a time machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.95,0:16:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but that's what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.11,0:16:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, they'll use
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:54.37,Default,,0,0,0,,a black hole's power and the lifter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.37,0:16:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,What else does it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Program Stage Three: Animal experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.71,0:17:00.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Program Stage Four...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.46,0:17:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Human experiments.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.59,0:17:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,"Human is dead, mismatch."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.09,0:17:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.22,0:17:14.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Part of an email we found when we first hacked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:15.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't the rest of it say...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.76,0:17:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,"the details are in Jellyman's report"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.89,0:17:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru, can you find the report?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.02,0:17:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I think so, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:23.69,Default,,0,0,0,,isn't that a bad idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.19,0:17:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If this is real, it's top secret stuff!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,After all this, you're scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.32,0:17:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.61,0:17:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're up against SERN,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.82,0:17:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,and the report's a top secret thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.91,0:17:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,hidden for over forty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.12,0:17:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're going to ignore it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.71,0:17:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,You should go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.87,0:17:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If you learn any more,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.46,0:17:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll be in danger too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.92,0:17:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a genius with a bright future ahead of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.55,0:17:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you worried about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.22,0:17:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You... You're my assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.22,0:17:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.89,0:18:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm not going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.39,0:18:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd be too bothered by this to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.73,0:18:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't regret it, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.11,0:18:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.90,0:18:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you, Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.11,0:18:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a super hacker.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.69,0:18:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't screw up so badly that they'd catch us for just looking at the report.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.03,0:18:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.20,0:18:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll now begin our analysis
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.62,0:18:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,of the Jellyman's report!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.87,0:18:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, this operation's name will be
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.45,0:18:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Laegjarn's Chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.29,0:18:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Why Norse mythology?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.96,0:18:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,And why does it even need an operation name at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.71,0:18:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Daru, begin the operation!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.00,0:18:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.51,0:18:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There are fourteen files in total.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.30,0:18:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll pick one at random.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.51,0:18:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Jellyman's Report 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.14,0:18:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Subject: James McCarthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.18,0:18:40.68,Default,,0,0,0,,American.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.68,0:18:43.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Experiment Date: 01/28/2005.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Z-Program 4 Experiment Result:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.36,0:18:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Human is dead, mismatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,That again?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.19,0:18:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It was believed he couldn't survive infinite compression via supergravity,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.32,0:18:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,or passing through the singularity inside the Kerr black hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.45,0:18:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,A newspaper article?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.62,0:18:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.79,0:19:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at the date!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,April 3, 1921.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.00,0:19:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,A man was found dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.58,0:19:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,on 14th Avenue, New York, buried inside a wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.55,0:19:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The body of this unidentified man
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.80,0:19:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,was found to be soft, like jelly...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.56,0:19:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What does this mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.18,0:19:25.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It means that, even if it isn't complete,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.89,0:19:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,they've succeeded in time travel?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.86,0:19:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Report 8.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.19,0:19:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Subject: Linda Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.44,0:19:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,British.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.69,0:19:34.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Z-Program 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.82,0:19:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Experiment Date: 02/15/2004.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.37,0:19:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Experiment Result: Human is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.33,0:19:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,mismatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.04,0:19:45.87,Default,,0,0,0,,October 2, 1972.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The body of a woman was found
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.79,0:19:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,in a jelly-like state on a road in Dharmapuri, Tamil Nadu, India.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,After being abandoned,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the body was believed to have been hit by a car, destroying the bottom half.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.64,0:19:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Report 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.76,0:20:01.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Subject: Michael Lang.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.47,0:20:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,German.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.68,0:20:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Z-Program 4.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.27,0:20:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Experiment Result: Human is dead, mismatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.11,0:20:12.11,Default,,0,0,0,,A Japanese newspaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.61,0:20:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,May 24, 1936.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.78,0:20:18.36,Default,,0,0,0,,A body was discovered at the foot of Mt. Hiei in Kyoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Fourteen of these?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.87,0:20:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to keep looking?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.24,0:20:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.75,0:20:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.20,0:20:28.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to get something to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.79,0:20:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems pretty shocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.00,0:20:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.67,0:20:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,But why do they turn to jelly?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.80,0:20:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,From the data I've seen,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.05,0:20:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe SERN is focusing their time travel
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.18,0:20:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,research on the use of Kerr black holes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.22,0:20:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That would mean
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.43,0:20:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,they're cramming 10^-21 grams into
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.35,0:20:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,a space of 10^-19 meters cubed and sending it to the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.98,0:20:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It would be like trying to fit this sponge through this hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.53,0:20:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As a result,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.49,0:21:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,everything is squeezed out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.49,0:21:02.57,Default,,0,0,0,,So, it's really tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.57,0:21:03.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.24,0:21:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,They're forcing something into a really tight spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That explanation's really erotic, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.04,0:21:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What's ero...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.08,0:21:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida, you pervert!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.50,0:21:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you have a considerable imagination too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.63,0:21:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't compare me to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.97,0:21:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.90,0:21:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just stand there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.36,0:21:35.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's shocking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.11,0:21:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But now that we know this,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.94,0:21:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to reach some sort of conclusion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.24,0:21:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.45,0:21:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Conclusion?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.87,0:21:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What other conclusion could there be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.33,0:21:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got Future Gadget #8,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.42,0:21:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,the PhoneWave (name subject to change).
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll complete a perfect time machine before SERN!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, we'll change the world's ruling structure!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.43,0:22:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're nuts, you know that?
